# Agent Orchestration (imported)

Purpose:
  Orchestration + token-economy skills from BuilderIO/skills. Watchdog audits
  agent work, plan-arbiter compares competing plans, efficient-frontier routes
  model tiers, quick-recap forces end-of-work status signals.

Owns: ./

Source: https://github.com/BuilderIO/skills
Origin: fetched from raw.githubusercontent.com (skills/{name}/SKILL.md)
Imported: 2026-09-06
Format: anthropic-skill (SKILL.md docs-only, adapted via INDEX.sdd wrapper)
License: MIT (repo-level, verified via GitHub API 2026-09-07)
Runtime: none (docs-only workflows)

Skills:
  agent-watchdog:
    one_line: Audit another agent's work from a thread/PR/commit/CI link
    use: SDDRA multi-agent chain QA — independent auditor
  plan-arbiter:
    one_line: Compare competing plans and choose a direction with rationale
    use: decision-ledger support for proposed → review → approved
  efficient-frontier:
    one_line: Reserve high-cost models for judgment; route cheap helpers for bulk work
    use: SDDRA token economy (Phase 147) — model-tier routing policy
  quick-recap:
    one_line: End every unit of work with a red/yellow/green status block
    use: session handoff + history.json discipline

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @agent-watchdog.md
   3  @plan-arbiter.md
   4  @efficient-frontier.md
   5  @quick-recap.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — run orchestration workflow on current chain
  AUDIT    — watchdog audit-only pass

Rules:
  [OR1] agent-watchdog output feeds the VR (verification) stage gate.
  [OR2] plan-arbiter decisions MUST be recorded in decision ledger.
  [OR3] efficient-frontier aligns with SDDRA token economy; do not burn frontier tokens on bulk tasks.
  [OR4] External origin — apply import rules from CLAUDE.md.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

Navigation:
  Orchestration: @INDEX.sdd
  AgentWatchdog: @agent-watchdog.md
  PlanArbiter: @plan-arbiter.md
  EfficientFrontier: @efficient-frontier.md
  QuickRecap: @quick-recap.md
  ImportedRegistry: @../INDEX.sdd

State: +
